# ============================================================
# Files that must NEVER be uploaded to Vercel.
#
# IMPORTANT: Vercel serves static files directly — server.js does NOT
# run there, so the 403 rules it enforces locally do not exist in
# production. This file is the ONLY thing stopping these from going
# public. Do not remove entries without understanding that.
# ============================================================

# --- SECRETS (MongoDB URI, JWT secret, Razorpay keys, admin password) ---
backend/
.env
.env.*
*.env

# --- server-side only: not used by the static site on Vercel ---
server.js
node_modules/

# --- local tooling / notes ---
.claude/
*.log
.DS_Store
BLOG-IMAGE-PROMPTS.md
BLOG-IMAGE-PROMPTS-100.md
README.md
